    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocation, Location, Location Exceptional Coastal Site with Panoramic Sea Views\nDNG Pierce Properties are delighted to present this exceptional coastal site at Roney Point, extending to approximately 0.4 acres (subject to planning permission).\nOccupying a truly enviable position in one of County Wexford's most desirable coastal locations, this outstanding site boasts breathtaking panoramic sea views, presenting a rare opportunity to create your dream coastal retreat.\nSituated within an exclusive gated coastal community, residents enjoy access to a host of premium lifestyle amenities, including private access to the beach, tennis courts, and a children's play area, creating the perfect environment for families, holidaymakers, and those seeking an idyllic seaside setting. \nJust a short stroll from both Roney Beach and Donaghmore Beach, the location offers the perfect balance of tranquillity and convenience. Whether you enjoy coastal walks, swimming, water sports, or simply taking in the spectacular scenery, this exceptional setting provides an unrivalled lifestyle opportunity.\nThe nearby village of Ballygarrett, just a five-minute drive away, offers a range of everyday amenities, while the picturesque Cahore Point is close by, renowned for its scenic coastline, sandy beaches, charming harbour, and relaxed village atmosphere.\nFor commuters, Gorey Town and the M11 motorway are approximately 15 minutes away, with Dublin's M50 reachable in around one hour, making this an ideal location for both permanent living and weekend escapes.\nOpportunities to acquire a site of this calibre in such a spectacular coastal setting are exceptionally rare. Combining stunning sea views, an exclusive gated setting, outstanding resident amenities, and endless potential (subject to planning permission), this is a unique opportunity to create a truly special coastal home.\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the exceptional location, breathtaking sea views, and exclusive lifestyle on offer.\n\nFeatures:\nApprox. 0.4-acre site (subject to planning permission)\nGated community, private access to the beach, children's play area & Tennis court.\nExceptional coastal setting at Roney Point with stunning coastal and sea views\n5 minutes to Ballygarrett Village and Cahore Point\n15 minutes to Gorey Town and the M11 motorway\nApproximately 1 hour to Dublin's M50\nFolio WX4050F"
      },
